# Sacred Cat's embalm {W} (CR 702.128a). Bot1 discards both Cats to Faithless Looting. A Cat in hand has no embalm to
# activate even with {W} floating. Paid with exactly that {W} (the pool is empty right after), the Cat in the graveyard is
# exiled and a token copy of it is made: white, a Cat Zombie with no mana cost (mana value 0), still a 1/1 with lifelink.
# With every mana source tapped the second Cat's embalm is not offered (the cost is {W}); on Bot2's turn 2 it is not offered
# even with {W} floating (sorcery speed), and on Bot1's own turn 3 it is, which makes the second token.

